      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**实验步骤：**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 沿着导杆把短焦距的会聚透镜（*物镜*）安装在被照得",
        "很亮的字母附近，两者间的距离比该透镜的焦距要稍微大一",
        "些. 透镜的焦距应是事先已知的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 利用有毫米格的玻璃，用视差的方法（见实验 $5$）找到",
        "字母的放大的倒立实像."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "3. 沿着导杆，在像后边的某个距离上安装第二个透镜",
        "（*目镜*）. 让这个距离等于该透镜的焦距或比焦距稍微小一些",
        "（目镜的焦距也应事先已知）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "撤去毫米格玻璃，像用放大镜那样，用目镜来观察字母的",
        "放大的像."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "八、利用棱镜观察光的色散现象"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**仪器和材料：**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "投影仪，带有氢、氖或氦的光谱管，高压电感器，蓄电池",
        "组，支架，导线（这些仪器对于所有年级来说都是通用的）；有",
        "斜边的玻璃板（发给每一个人）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**实验步骤：**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 把玻璃板水平地放在眼睛的前面，透过 $45^\\circ$ 角的",
        "边观察屏幕上的明亮竖条纹——投影仪所分开的狭缝",
        "的像."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 分辨所获得的连续光谱的各基本颜色，按观察到的顺",
        "序把它们记录下来."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "3. 通过 $60^\\circ$ 角的边观察条纹，重复实验，记下不同形式",
        "的光谱."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
